WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,940 --> 00:00:01,840
She is my captain

2
00:00:02,300 --> 00:00:05,870
You should be older than her. I am twenty years old.

3
00:00:06,190 --> 00:00:07,270
Two years older than the captain

4
00:00:09,700 --> 00:00:10,740
It turns out it can still be like this

5
00:00:10,940 --> 00:00:15,860
Then can Wen Chen also be my captain? Sorry?

6
00:00:16,490 --> 00:00:17,650
Teaming up with me will kill you

7
00:00:18,010 --> 00:00:23,150
Recruiting him here is not asking him to die, so why not follow me?

8
00:00:23,740 --> 00:00:24,860
I don’t have any teammates now either

9
00:00:25,750 --> 00:00:27,990
You're just a Tangbapi, but that's okay

10
00:00:28,110 --> 00:00:29,070
I'll reluctantly agree

11
00:00:29,630 --> 00:00:30,990
You guys chat, I'll go back to the dormitory first

12
00:00:31,430 --> 00:00:36,660
Okay, I'll take you back to school at half past six tomorrow morning, captain.

13
00:00:37,100 --> 00:00:38,460
My dormitory is arranged next to yours

14
00:00:40,490 --> 00:00:45,130
Captain, can you tell me what's bothering you? My trouble is him.

15
00:00:45,810 --> 00:00:47,090
Qi Xuan I said

16
00:00:47,450 --> 00:00:49,490
Teaming up with me is very dangerous and you might die.

17
00:00:50,100 --> 00:00:51,020
I'm most afraid of debt

18
00:00:51,300 --> 00:00:52,300
Especially life debt
